{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Cinder 是一款專為 iPhone、iPad 及 Apple Silicon Mac 設計的影片壓縮工具，讓你在裝置上直接縮小影片檔案，無需上傳至伺服器，適合需要快速整理或分享影片的用戶。目前原價 US $0.99，正限時免費中。</p>\n\n<h2>影片壓縮功能</h2>\n<p>Cinder 可從分享表單、照片或檔案 App 加入影片，提供 Small 或 Balanced 快速預設，亦可自訂編碼、解析度、位元率、音訊、幀率及關鍵影格間隔。支援批次處理多部影片，並可比較壓縮前後的檔案大小、解析度、幀率、位元率與時長。完成後可輸出至照片、分享至其他 App，或儲存至 iCloud Drive 的 Cinder 資料夾。所有壓縮均在裝置上完成，不需帳號，保障私隱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-527-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-528-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-529-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-530-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-531-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-532-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Cinder – compress videos</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T05:00:01.196890+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":379,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}